Changes made for this project:

- SKILL.md is rewritten in Japanese for the docx_create tool of Production Ready Agent.
  Only the guidance that applies to that tool is kept: write lists as list items, and use a
  table only for tabular values (not for layout or as a rule line). The rule that bullet
  characters and numbers are not typed into the item text is stated in the argument
  description of the docx_create tool (agent/backend/app/features/agent/docx_tool.py).
- The following guidance is applied in the generator of the docx_create tool
  (agent/backend/app/features/agent/docx_document.py) instead of in SKILL.md: an explicit
  A4 page size, separate paragraphs instead of line breaks (a line break in the text of a
  paragraph starts a new paragraph), table widths written in DXA on the table, the column
  grid and every cell, table shading with the "clear" pattern, and heading levels that use
  the built-in heading styles, each with its own font, spacing before and after, and
  keep-with-next.
- Everything else is not included: the scripts, running code (docx-js, Python, pandoc,
  LibreOffice), reading and editing existing files, unpacking and validating the XML,
  tracked changes, comments, images, tables of contents, and landscape pages.
